        <link>http://alephnull.com/w/recipes/pancakes?rev=1240009454&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Blueberry  Buttermilk Pancakes (revised by Elaine Magee, Recipe Doctor)
4 Servings

Ingredients:

	*  1 cup flour
	*  1 teaspoon baking powder
	*  1/2 teaspoon baking soda
	*  1/4 teaspoon salt
	*  1 tablespoon sugar
	*  1 large beaten egg
	*  1 and 1/4 cup buttermilk
	*  1 tablespoon canola oil or melted butter
	*  1 tablespoon maple syrup
	*  1 teaspoon vanilla extract
	*  1 cup fresh or frozen blueberries</description>
    </item>
